sound OI8.aac
text @[Yagi]
text The size of the room doesn't have anything to do with it.
sound OI9.aac
text @[Yagi]
text What's more important is that it's an environment where the mother can relax.
sound OIA.aac
text @[Yagi]
text Over the course of a pregnancy, a mother will feel anxious and find themselves physically affected in many different ways.
sound OIB.aac
